; ── Regression: zero-arg closure param in a default-arg fn freed too early ──
; A module-nested fn with default-arg params AND a trailing zero-arg closure
; param desugars (general match-merge path) into a tuple build + destructure.
; A zero-arg lambda `fn () -> T` is typed as a thunk `T` (not a function), so
; the captured closure param is non-TFn-typed; defun only rewrote EApp→ECallPtr
; for TFn/TVar callees, leaving `render_inner()` as EApp(render_inner, []).
